    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見つけてくれて
サンキュー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you found me!
Thank you~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ご褒美よ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here, a reward!
</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……では、サラバっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And with that... Farewell!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なんか、
木が枯れてるんだけど
暑さのせい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...The trees seem pretty wilted.
Is that 'cause of the heat?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ってもう何年も
暑いんだけど、今更？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Wait, it's been hot like
this for ages. Why now?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もしかして、
前よりも暑くなってる？
だから木が枯れた？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe it's even hotter than
it used to be? And that's
making the trees wilt?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いやいや……
あ、でも昨日より
今日は少し暑いかも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That can't be it... Though...
I think it is a little hotter
today than it was yesterday...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ～、なんか椰子の木の
葉っぱの色が変だなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's this~? The color
of those palm leaves has
gone all funny, hasn't it...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまけに元気がない……
なんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And they really don't look
like they're doing too well,
either... What's that about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>植物が元気がない時には
水をやるのが一番だね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When your plants aren't
doing well, the best thing
to do is water 'em.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>宿屋の前のアイツ……
どうして……平気……なんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why's that guy...in front of the
old inn...look like he's...doing fine...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暑い……もう死ぬ……
今死ぬ……
いや死なない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so hot... I'm gonna
die... Gonna die right
now... No, I won't die...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やばい……やばすぎる……
この暑さ……禁魔術級……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is bad... This is really
bad... This heat... It's like
some forbidden dark magic...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>目の前に、水があるのに……
飲めない……つらさ……
君たちは知らないだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seeing water...right in front of you...
But you can't drink it... Such pain...
You've never felt it, have ya?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクの肉って
意外とやわらかくて
脂のってて美味いんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Basilisk meat is surprisingly
supple. They say it has good
marbling, too, and tastes great.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、みんな気味悪がって
食わなかったそうだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But generally, no one would eat
it, 'cause it gave 'em the creeps.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今でもバジリスク料理っての
あるみたいだけど
高級料理なのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Some people actually cook with
basilisk meat even now, and it's
considered a delicacy, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一度、食ってはみたいが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'd like to try it
at least once, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔女のヤツめ！　許さん！
今度はホッケ焼いてたら
まんまと持っていきやがった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That accursed witch! She won't get
away with this! I grilled a mackerel
and she made right off with it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>にゃーんとか鳴きやがって
なんのマネだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She let out some weird
"nyaaan" cry, too! What
the hell's she playing at!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレの大事な夕食を！
オレの大切なホッケちゃんを！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My precious dinner!
My cherished mackerel!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>返せ！　バカやろー！
あ、魔女だからヤローじゃないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Give it back! You son of a...!
Wait, she's a witch, so I guess
"son" isn't the right word...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暑い～…今日の夕飯は
チーズINハンバーグかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so hot... Maybe I'll have
cheeseburg steak for dinner.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>309620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チーズがとろけてて
おいしいんだよねー！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That melty cheese
really is the best!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
